4. Simple Log Parser (file + try/except + datetime)
Goal:
A log file (app.log) contains lines like:

text
ERROR 2025-03-20 10:15:00 Disk full
INFO 2025-03-20 10:20:00 Backup started
ERROR 2025-03-20 10:21:00 Backup failed
Write a program that:

Asks the user for a date (YYYY-MM-DD).

Prints all ERROR lines from that date.

Ignores missing file or incorrect date input using try/except.

Extension:
Count how many errors occurred on that day.

